     $ =====================================================================         
     $ RBE3 BUG TEST DECK B -- DX_BAR/DY_BAR/DZ_BAR SELF-COUPLING BUG                
     $ (RBE3_PROC.F90, LINES |239-241 AND |315-420; NOT COVERED BY ISSUE #224)       
     $                                                                               
     $ FULL 6-DOF RBE3 (REFC=123456) WITH 4 INDEPENDENT GRIDS, EACH GIVEN            
     $ A DIFFERENT WEIGHT ON ITS X, Y AND Z TRANSLATIONAL COMPONENTS                 
     $ (THREE SEPARATE WTI/CI GROUPS PER GRID BELOW). THIS IS THE                    
     $ "DIFFERENTIAL PER-DOF WEIGHT" PATTERN THAT BOTH THE WRITE_L1J_456             
     $ BUG (DECK A) AND THIS DX_BAR/DY_BAR/DZ_BAR BUG REQUIRE TO MANIFEST.           
     $                                                                               
     $ THE 4 INDEPENDENT GRIDS ARE DRIVEN BY SPC TO THE EXACT RIGID-BODY             
     $ FIELD  U_I = U0 + OMEGA X R_I  FOR:                                           
     $     U0    = ( 0.37, -0.82,  1.15)                                             
     $     OMEGA = ( 0.21, -0.44,  0.63)                                             
     $                                                                               
     $ ANY CORRECT WEIGHTED LEAST-SQUARES RBE3 FIT MUST RECOVER THIS U0              
     $ AND OMEGA EXACTLY AT THE REFERENCE GRID, FOR ANY WEIGHTS -- A RIGID           
     $ FIELD HAS ZERO FIT RESIDUAL REGARDLESS OF WEIGHTING. THIS IS                  
     $ INDEPENDENT OF (AND ADDITIONAL TO) THE DECK A BUG: EVEN WITH                  
     $ WRITE_L1J_456 FIXED, THIS DECK WILL STILL SHOW A LARGE ERROR UNLESS           
     $ DX_BAR/DY_BAR/DZ_BAR ARE ALSO CORRECTED TO THE FULL 6-TERM                    
     $ CROSS-WEIGHTED SUMS DESCRIBED IN THE REPORT.                                  
     $                                                                               
     $ EXPECTED (CORRECT FORMULATION), GRID 900:                                     
     $   T1=0.37  T2=-0.82  T3=1.15   R1=0.21  R2=-0.44  R3=0.63                     
     $                                                                               
     $ ACTUAL (AS-CODED, BUGGY), GRID 900 (FROM AN INDEPENDENT PYTHON                
     $ RE-IMPLEMENTATION OF RBE3_PROC.F90'S EXACT FORMULAS):                         
     $   T1=2.409  T2=-0.071  T3=4.349   R1=1.051  R2=-5.492  R3=0.703               
     $ (OFF BY ROUGHLY 1 TO 6X ON EVERY COMPONENT -- NOT A ROUNDING-LEVEL            
     $ DISCREPANCY)                                                                  
     $ =====================================================================         
